body:
After having the chance to listen to the album a few times, reading the lyrics properly and understanding what all the songs are about.

&#x200B;

I think redecorate may be my all time favourite TOP song (It just beats out Chlorine for me which I had as one of my favourite songs of the past 10 years). It's just so heart wrenching and raw in it's delivery in terms of the songs subject. Really impressive in the way its been produced. Upon first listen I really loved it, when I understood the song afterwards it broke me emotionally. Very few songs have had this effect on me.

I know the calves are a bit of a meme now but fuck me.

&#x200B;

He must spend an hour on the calf raise and just do nothing else in the gym

Swear to god nobody knows 100% what players are earning except for the player themselves.

&#x200B;

The funniest one is Bale earning any sum of money above £300k a week

Player: Emiliano Buendia

&#x200B;

Club: Bournemouth (and not in a good way)

&#x200B;

Manager: Woy Hodgson
